   634→### Fluid Typography Scale
   635→
   636→```css
   637→/* Source: Smashing Magazine - Modern Fluid Typography Using CSS Clamp */
   638→/* https://www.smashingmagazine.com/2022/01/modern-fluid-typography-css-clamp/ */
   639→
   640→:root {
   641→  /* Base text: 16px → 18px */
   642→  --text-base: clamp(1rem, 0.9rem + 0.5vw, 1.125rem);
   643→
   644→  /* Small text: 14px → 15px */
   645→  --text-sm: clamp(0.875rem, 0.85rem + 0.25vw, 0.9375rem);
   646→
   647→  /* Large text: 18px → 20px */
   648→  --text-lg: clamp(1.125rem, 1.05rem + 0.5vw, 1.25rem);
   649→
   650→  /* Headings - larger scale */
   651→  --text-h1: clamp(2rem, 1.5rem + 2vw, 3rem);          /* 32px → 48px */
   652→  --text-h2: clamp(1.5rem, 1.25rem + 1vw, 2rem);       /* 24px → 32px */
   653→  --text-h3: clamp(1.25rem, 1.125rem + 0.5vw, 1.5rem); /* 20px → 24px */
   654→  --text-h4: clamp(1.125rem, 1.05rem + 0.4vw, 1.25rem);/* 18px → 20px */
   655→}
   656→
   657→body {
   658→  font-size: var(--text-base);
   659→  line-height: 1.6;
   660→}
   661→
   662→h1 { font-size: var(--text-h1); line-height: 1.2; }
   663→h2 { font-size: var(--text-h2); line-height: 1.3; }
   664→h3 { font-size: var(--text-h3); line-height: 1.4; }
   665→```
